# NOTE 07: PYTEST AUTOMATED TESTING & DOCKER DEPLOYMENT NOTES
## Complete Bit-by-Bit Study Guide for Testing & Containerizing Zaika

================================================================================
1. WHY AUTOMATED TESTING & DOCKER ELEVATE YOUR PROJECT
================================================================================
Adding automated `pytest` tests and Docker containerization separates a production-ready engineering project from a basic student CRUD demo:
1. Automated Proof of Validation (`pytest`): Proves your FastAPI endpoints properly accept valid orders (`201 Created`), block invalid negative inputs (`422 Unprocessable Entity`), and enforce Role-Based Access Control (`401`/`403`).
2. One-Command Deployment (`Docker`): Packages your FastAPI backend, Streamlit frontend, and MySQL database into isolated containers so anyone can run your entire app with `docker-compose up --build`.

Required Packages:
```bash
pip install pytest httpx
```

